# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 feature changes {#qiskit-v10-feature-changes}"
msgstr "Changements de fonctionnalités dans Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-v10-feature-changes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v1.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce guide décrit les chemins de migration pour les changements de fonctionnalités les plus importants dans Qiskit 1.0, organisés par module.\n"
"Utilise la table des matières du côté droit pour naviguer vers le module qui t'intéresse.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 migration tool {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"
msgstr "Outil de migration Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ease the migration process, you can use the\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool to detect removed import paths in your code and suggest alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour faciliter le processus de migration, tu peux utiliser l'outil\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"pour détecter les chemins d'importation supprimés dans ton code et suggérer des alternatives.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Run with pipx\" default>\n"
"      If you have [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installed, simply run\n"
"      the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Exécute avec pipx\" default>\n"
"      Si tu as [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installé, exécute simplement\n"
"      la commande suivante.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      This will install the package to a temporary virtual environment and run\n"
"      it on your code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Run with venv\" default>\n"
"      If you don't want to use `pipx`, you can manually create a new\n"
"      environment for the tool. This approach also lets you use\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) to check code examples in\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. Delete the environment when you're finished.\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      Cela installera le paquet dans un environnement virtuel temporaire et l'exécutera\n"
"      sur ton code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Exécute avec venv\" default>\n"
"      Si tu ne veux pas utiliser `pipx`, tu peux créer manuellement un nouvel\n"
"      environnement pour l'outil. Cette approche te permet aussi d'utiliser\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) pour vérifier les exemples de code dans\n"
"      les notebooks Jupyter. Supprime l'environnement quand tu as fini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"
msgstr ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"This tool only detects removed import paths. It does not detect the use of removed\n"
"methods (such as `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) or arguments. It also can't keep track\n"
"of assignments such as `qk = qiskit`, although it can handle aliases such as\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"Cet outil ne détecte que les chemins d'importation supprimés. Il ne détecte pas l'utilisation de méthodes\n"
"supprimées (comme `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) ni d'arguments. Il ne peut pas non plus suivre\n"
"les affectations comme `qk = qiskit`, bien qu'il puisse gérer les alias comme\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [project's\n"
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour plus d'informations, consulte le [dépôt du\n"
"projet](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"

