"La méthode `QuantumCircuit.qasm` a été supprimée. À la place, utilise\n"
"[`qasm2.dump`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dump) ou\n"
"[`qasm2.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dumps).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
