# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Importing from `qiskit.providers.aer` is no longer possible. Instead, import\n"
"from `qiskit_aer`, which is a drop-in replacement. To install `qiskit_aer`,\n"
"run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Il n'est plus possible d'importer depuis `qiskit.providers.aer`. À la place, importe\n"
"depuis `qiskit_aer`, qui est un remplacement direct. Pour installer `qiskit_aer`,\n"
"exécute :\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install qiskit-aer\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install qiskit-aer\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for running pulse jobs on backends from\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) has\n"
"been removed in Qiskit v1.0.  This is because Qiskit Aer removed its\n"
"simulation functionality for such jobs.  For low-level Hamiltonian-simulation\n"
"workloads, consider using a specialized library such as [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"
msgstr ""
"En Qiskit 1.0, le support pour exécuter les travaux de pulse sur les backends de\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) a\n"
"été supprimé. C'est parce que Qiskit Aer a supprimé ses fonctionnalités de\n"
"simulation pour ce type de travaux. Pour les charges de travail de simulation hamiltonienne de bas niveau,\n"
"envisage d'utiliser une bibliothèque spécialisée comme [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"

